Subject: [PATCH] Remove the eMudhra emSign G1 root from webpki-roots

Remove emSign Root CA - G1's comment and TrustAnchor record from the crate's root certificate set to enforce Azure Linux's eMudhra certificate exclusion policy.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
